  "ruleText": "Pda 101.20 \"Length overall\" (LOA) means the distance in feet of the vessel from stem to stern plus the length of any pulpits, anchors, davits, swim platforms, dinghies, or other attachments to the vessel.\n\nSource. #7847, eff 3-8-03; ss and renumbered by #8146, eff 8-28-04 (from Pda 101.16); renumbered by #8298 (from Pda 101.17); ss and moved by #8760, eff 11-18-06 (from Pda 101.14)",
